<BaseLayout title="Claude vs TotalRecalls" description="Claude official export vs. TotalRecalls.">
  <h1>Claude vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>Anthropic does not provide a native data export tool for chats. TotalRecalls reads your local Claude.ai session and converts it to a durable library.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official export:</strong> Not available.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Markdown + JSON export with model metadata (3.5 Sonnet, Haiku).</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
